# The transparency sample, which F7 in mygame switches to: tinted glass boxes that pass through each other and through
# an opaque pillar, with moment-based transparency on the left and sorted draws on the right, nested glass spheres
# around a gold one, an additive hologram behind them, a Particle_System whose smoke rises beside the glass and drifts
# through it while its sparks bounce on the floor, and a spinner that draws a ribbon trail (see
# docs/rendering/particles.md#particles), under an atmosphere's sky whose sun is the Sun's light (see
# docs/rendering/sky.md#sky). The editor writes this file; see docs/editor.md#scenes.
